API key valid? [shape: diamond, color: yellow]
Reject 401 [shape: rectangle, color: red]
Record matches contract? [shape: diamond, color: yellow]
Reject 400 with field errors [shape: rectangle, color: red]
ID already stored? [shape: diamond, color: yellow]
Reject 409 duplicate [shape: rectangle, color: red]
Settings row present? [shape: diamond, color: yellow]
Return 503 run seed-config [shape: rectangle, color: red]
Score with inference service [icon: cpu, color: purple]
Scoring succeeded? [shape: diamond, color: yellow]
Store as scoring_failed and return 503 [shape: rectangle, color: orange]
Probability ≥ threshold? [shape: diamond, color: yellow]
Mark high risk and create open alert [color: red]
Mark low risk [color: green]
Commit transaction + alert + daily stats in one DB transaction [icon: database, color: blue]
Push live update to dashboards [icon: radio]
Return 201 [color: green]
End [shape: oval, color: black, label: ""]

